ettings":{"title":"How much does it cost to develop an app like FirstCry?","title_color":"#FFFFFF","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":23,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"700","typography_line_height_mobile":{"unit":"em","size":1.5,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]},"header_size":"p"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"4c2d937d","elType":"widget","settings":{"space_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"47d78e14","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<a style="color: white; text-decoration: none;" href="https://reapmind.com"> <strong>Reapmind Innovations</strong> </a> / <strong>August 1, 2023</strong>","text_color":"#FFFFFF","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":14.6,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"312a33dc","elType":"widget","settings":{"space_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":251,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"654750b6","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"54a58495","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"21cf179f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"How much does it cost to develop an app like FirstCry?","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"5ae3531c","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"635d0331","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Being a parent is a great feeling and this feeling comes along with a bag full of emotions and responsibilities to giving at most comfort to the baby just like the womb is the prior most responsibility. The moment good news of to-be parents knows the doors, most of the folks get puzzled with the shopping visiting multiple layouts. But now with the boom in the baby care segment, most of the brands with baby products have opted to go online with <strong>mobile app development like <a href="https://www.firstcry.com/">FirstCry</a></strong>. The market of baby shops has witnessed a sharp rise in the revenue with the least investment and hence most of the entrepreneurs from this business segment think twice about the investment before they set up an innovative business idea. <strong>Does a baby shopping app like FirstCry development cost</strong> your concern as well? Developing an app like the first cry is a cost-effective approach that serves you with the highest ROI along with branding solutions.</p><p><a href="https://reapmind.com/contact-us/"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-104181 size-full" src="https://reapmind.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/1st-blog-image-50.png" alt="How much does it cost to develop an app like FirstCry?" width="1832" height="680" /></a></p><p>The cost to develop a baby shopping app like the first cry depends on various aspects, such as features incorporated, size of the app development team, location from where you are hiring your team, the complexity of the app, mobile platform, and more. Let’s understand these aspects in deep to determine the <a href="https://reapmind.com/mobile-app-development-company/"><strong>cost estimation for FirstCry app development</strong>.</a></p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"597a49ea","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"1d7db65","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"317bd6ce","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Factor 1: Must have features and complexities","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"16e71af8","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"2410aaf2","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h4>Basic features:<img class="aligncenter wp-image-104186 size-full" src="https://reapmind.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Group-2608811.png" alt="Factor 1: Must have features and complexities" width="3964" height="3440" /></h4><div class="features-list"><ul><li>Profile creation</li><li>Search option</li><li>Filters</li><li>Payment gateway</li><li>Shopping cart</li><li>In-built wallet</li></ul></div><p><strong>Complexities:</strong></p><div class="responsive-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Type of complexities</th><th>Attributes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Type of complexities">Simple apps</td><td data-label="Attributes">– No add-on benefits<br />– Has only basic features<br />– Low-tech screens<br />– Only contains basic UI solutions</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Type of complexities">Mid-level apps</td><td data-label="Attributes">– Extra benefits with complicated coding<br />– API integration<br />– Custom user interface<br />– More screens<br />– Exception features like real-time chatting</td></tr><tr><td data-label="Type of complexities">Complex apps</td><td data-label="Attributes">– Multifunctional<br />– Chatbots<br />– UI animation<br />– Advanced features<br />– Media processing<br />– Real-time synchronization</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Baby shopping app like Firstcry’s development cost depends on the type of the app because of variation in the time required for the development. Most of the resources are hired on an hourly basis and more development time means more cost for app development.</p><p>The time to develop apps with various complexity levels are listed below:</p><p>Simple apps: 2 to 4 months</p><p>Mid-level complexity apps: 6 to 10 months</p><p>Complex level: 8-12 months</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"32cbdf89","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"48fda968","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"855e573","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Factor 2: Mobile app development platform","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"704cffc7","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"66315534","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"The two most prevailing mobile platforms for app development are Android and iOS. Either people choose to develop native apps which are specifically for a certain platform or choose to pave out all the targeted customers by choosing cross-platform app development which allows the developer to use the same code for various mobile platforms.
